<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Karte</title>
    <style>
      /* Bez vanjskih stilova: PDF se crta u Puppeteeru, a mreza koja ceka CDN
         zna dati stranicu bez stilova ako veza zapne. Sve je ovdje. */
      @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        color: #383E42;
        -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
        print-color-adjust: exact;
      }

      /* Jedna karta = jedna stranica. Zadnja nema prijelom, inace PDF zavrsi
         praznom stranicom. */
      .page {
        width: 210mm;
        height: 297mm;
        padding: 16mm 16mm 14mm;
        page-break-after: always;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
      }
      .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }

      .brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-end;
        justify-content: space-between;
        border-bottom: 3px solid #175BD0;
        padding-bottom: 6mm;
      }
      .brand .name { font-size: 22pt; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .5px; }
      .brand .doc { font-size: 10pt; color: #6b7280; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; }

      /* Sadrzaj se centrira izmedu zaglavlja i napomene. Bez toga vise od pola
         stranice ostane prazno ispod, a karta izgleda kao odsjecen ispis. */
      .content { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
      .headline { }
      .route {
        font-size: 30pt;
        font-weight: 800;
        line-height: 1.15;
      }
      .route .arrow { color: #175BD0; margin: 0 4mm; }
      .line { margin-top: 2mm; font-size: 12pt; color: #6b7280; }

      .main { margin-top: 10mm; display: flex; gap: 12mm; }
      .facts { flex: 1; }

      .fact { margin-bottom: 7mm; }
      .fact .k {
        font-size: 9pt; color: #6b7280; text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin-bottom: 1.5mm;
      }
      .fact .v { font-size: 15pt; font-weight: 700; }
      .fact .v small { font-size: 10pt; font-weight: 400; color: #6b7280; }

      /* QR je razlog zbog kojeg karta postoji na papiru — dobiva prostora. */
      .qr { width: 56mm; text-align: center; }
      .qr img { width: 52mm; height: 52mm; }
      .qr .code {
        margin-top: 3mm;
        font-family: "Courier New", Courier, monospace;
        font-size: 13pt; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px;
        word-break: break-all;
      }
      .qr .suffix { color: #6b7280; }

      .island {
        margin-top: 4mm; padding: 4mm 5mm;
        background: #F5F2EB; border-left: 4px solid #96D1F2;
        font-size: 10pt;
      }
      .island b { font-size: 11pt; }

      .spacer { flex: 1; }

      .notes {
        border-top: 1px solid #d1d5db;
        padding-top: 4mm;
        font-size: 8.5pt;
        color: #6b7280;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }
      .counter { float: right; font-weight: 700; color: #383E42; }

      /* --- sazetak --- */
      .sum-title { margin-top: 10mm; font-size: 20pt; font-weight: 800; }
      .sum-sub { margin-top: 1mm; font-size: 11pt; color: #6b7280; }
      table.sum { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 8mm; font-size: 10.5pt; }
      table.sum th {
        text-align: left; font-size: 8.5pt; text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 2px solid #383E42;
        padding: 0 0 2mm;
      }
      table.sum td { padding: 3mm 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; vertical-align: top; }
      table.sum td.code { font-family: "Courier New", Courier, monospace; font-weight: 700; }
      table.sum .muted { color: #6b7280; font-size: 9pt; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>

    <% if (summary) { %>
      <%# Sazetak je prva stranica, ne zaseban dokument: karte se svugdje
          otvaraju kao jedan PDF — u kartici preglednika i kao privitak. %>
      <div class="page">
        <div class="brand">
          <div class="name"><%= companyName %></div>
          <div class="doc">Sažetak</div>
        </div>

        <div class="sum-title"><%= ticketsData.length %> karata</div>
        <div class="sum-sub">
          <% if (summary.route) { %><%= summary.route %><% } %>
          <% if (summary.departure) { %> &middot; <%= summary.departure %><% } %>
        </div>

        <table class="sum">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th style="width:22%">Broj karte</th>
              <th style="width:28%">Vrsta</th>
              <th style="width:32%">Relacija</th>
              <th style="width:18%">Polazak</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <% ticketsData.forEach(function (ti) { %>
              <tr>
                <td class="code"><%= ti.ticket_code %></td>
                <td>
                  <%= ti.ticket_type_name || "" %>
                  <% if (ti.is_island && ti.seop_card_no) { %>
                    <div class="muted"><%= ti.seop_card_no %></div>
                  <% } %>
                </td>
                <td><%= ti.departure_harbor_name || "" %> → <%= ti.arrival_harbor_name || "" %></td>
                <td><%= ti.departure_fmt || ti.departure || "" %></td>
              </tr>
            <% }); %>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <div class="spacer"></div>
        <div class="notes">
          Sažetak služi za pregled i predaju na ukrcaju. Za ukrcaj vrijedi pojedinačna
          karta s QR kodom, na stranicama koje slijede.
        </div>
      </div>
    <% } %>

    <% ticketsData.forEach(function (ti, i) { %>
      <div class="page">
        <div class="brand">
          <div class="name"><%= companyName %></div>
          <div class="doc">Prijevozna karta</div>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
        <div class="headline">
          <div class="route">
            <%= ti.departure_harbor_name || "" %><span class="arrow">→</span><%= ti.arrival_harbor_name || "" %>
          </div>
          <% if (ti.line_name) { %><div class="line"><%= ti.line_name %></div><% } %>
        </div>

        <div class="main">
          <div class="facts">
            <div class="fact">
              <div class="k">Polazak</div>
              <div class="v"><%= ti.departure_fmt || ti.departure || "" %></div>
            </div>
            <div class="fact">
              <div class="k">Dolazak</div>
              <div class="v"><%= ti.arrival_fmt || ti.arrival || "—" %></div>
            </div>
            <div class="fact">
              <div class="k">Vrsta karte</div>
              <div class="v"><%= ti.ticket_type_name || "" %></div>
            </div>
            <% if (ti.is_island && ti.seop_card_no) { %>
              <div class="island">
                Otočna karta &middot; <b><%= ti.seop_card_no %></b>
                <% if (ti.seop_pravo) { %><br /><%= ti.seop_pravo %><% } %>
                <% if (ti.seop_otok) { %> &middot; <%= ti.seop_otok %><% } %>
              </div>
            <% } %>
          </div>

          <div class="qr">
            <img src="<%= ti.qr_data_url %>" alt="QR" />
            <div class="code">
              <%= ti.ticket_code %><% if (ti.ticket_code_suffix) { %> <span class="suffix"><%= ti.ticket_code_suffix %></span><% } %>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        </div>

        <div class="notes">
          <span class="counter">Karta <%= i + 1 %>/<%= ticketsData.length %></span>
          Kartu s QR kodom obavezno predočite pri ukrcaju.<br />
          You are obligated to present the code printed on the ticket while boarding.<br />
          Dozvoljena osobna prtljaga do 23 kg / Maximum luggage weight up to 23 kg.
        </div>
      </div>
    <% }); %>

  </body>
</html>
